## 3. Global 5-Continent `hx node` PoUW UDP Testnet & Native `hx httpd` Edge

The unified native binary `hx` compiles down to a single ~700 KB zero-UB C11 executable with **zero runtime dependencies** (`libc` only) and **< 15 MB peak RSS**.

### 3.1 Minimal Production Container (`scratch` / `alpine`, < 20 MB image)
```dockerfile
FROM alpine:3.20 AS build
RUN apk add --no-cache clang musl-dev make
WORKDIR /src
COPY . .
RUN make -j$(nproc) && \
    printf '#run (scmd (w-file-write-named "/tmp/hx.c" hx-c) (λ _ → sdone unit))\n' > /tmp/e_hx.hypercubical && \
    ./build/cubical lib/hx.hypercubical /tmp/e_hx.hypercubical && \
    clang -std=c11 -O3 -static -o /usr/local/bin/hx /tmp/hx.c

FROM scratch
COPY --from=build /usr/local/bin/hx /hx
COPY --from=build /src/store /store
EXPOSE 8080/tcp 7000/udp
ENTRYPOINT ["/hx"]
CMD ["httpd", "8080", "10000000"]
```

